    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>Crystals sewn into this electric-blue cloak are shards of a decommissioned mythallar. The cloak has 10 charges and regains 1d10 expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>While wearing the cloak, you can take a Bonus Action and expend 1 charge to activate its magic, which lasts for 1 minute or until you end it early (no action required).</p><p>While the magic is active, you have a Fly Speed of 30 feet and can hover. In addition, once on each of your turns when you hit a creature with an attack roll and deal damage, you can make the target take an extra 1d4 Radiant damage. If you are aloft when the cloak’s magic ends, you fall.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
